<title>USA: Carmike Cinemas buys screens in new states.</title>
<headline>Carmike Cinemas buys screens in new states.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ga. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carmike Cinemas Inc said on Wednesday that it had acquired 104 cinema screens, adding two new states to its geographic presence and increasing its screen count to 2,700.</p>
<p>Carmike did not disclose a purchase price, but said the transaction consisted of stock and cash.</p>
<p>Carmike, with screens in 35 states, is a motion picture exhibitor that specializes in operating theatres in small towns.</p>
</text>
